From: nura-builds
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: msm8226-generated: Samsung S6E8AA0A of the Galaxy S III Neo

The S III Neo's 720x1280 AMOLED in video mode, 4 lanes, as the generated
MSM8226 panel drivers: the init sequence and fixed gamma from the vendor
device tree (dsi-panel-s6e8aa0a-720p-video.dtsi), the power (disp-on)
and reset lines and reset sequence from the board's. No smart dimming,
so no brightness control yet.
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Kconfig
index 52de0ad..cff4558 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Kconfig
@@ -13,4 +13,8 @@ config DRM_PANEL_LG_LENOK_LG4237
 	tristate "Lg LENOK LG4237"
 	default DRM_PANEL_MSM8226_GENERATED
 
+config DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S3VE3G_S6E8AA0A
+	tristate "Samsung S3VE3G S6E8AA0A"
+	default DRM_PANEL_MSM8226_GENERATED
+
 endmenu
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Makefile
index 4228332..7b9e933 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/msm8226-generated/Makefile
@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@
